  "question": "设 $x > 2$ ，证明 $\\ln (x + 2) = 2\\ln (1 + x) - 2\\ln (x - 1) + \\ln (x - 2) + 2\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{2n-1}\\left(\\frac{2}{x^3 - 3x}\\right)^{2n-1}$ .",
  "answer": "得证",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "证明技巧",
    "收敛半径与收敛域"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 将所证等式改写为 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{2n-1} \\left( \\frac{2}{x^3 - 3x} \\right)^{2n-1} = \\frac{1}{2} \\ln \\frac{(x+2)(x-1)^2}{(x+1)^2(x-2)}$ ，这是级数求和问题."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "记 $y = \\frac{2}{x^3 - 3x}$ ， $S(y) = \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{2n-1} y^{2n-1}$ ，则"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "$$\nS (y) = \\sum_ {n = 1} ^ {\\infty} \\int_ {0} ^ {y} t ^ {2 n - 2} d t = \\int_ {0} ^ {y} \\left(\\sum_ {n = 1} ^ {\\infty} t ^ {2 n - 2}\\right) d t = \\int_ {0} ^ {y} \\frac {1}{1 - t ^ {2}} d t = \\frac {1}{2} \\ln \\frac {1 + y}{1 - y}, | y | <   1.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "代入 $y = \\frac{2}{x^3 - 3x}$ ，即得"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "$$\n\\sum_ {n - 1} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {1}{2 n - 1} \\left(\\frac {2}{x ^ {3} - 3 x}\\right) ^ {2 n - 1} = \\frac {1}{2} \\ln \\frac {(x + 2) (x - 1) ^ {2}}{(x + 1) ^ {2} (x - 2)}, \\quad x > 2.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "原等式得证."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "得证",
